        "valueString": "99% on room air"
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports no improvement; approximately 7/10 at worst, described as a deep ache in the lateral/posterior left shoulder. Worse with overhead movement and reaching behind the back; sleep disturbed, especially lying on the left side."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder function"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Still working and avoiding lifting; active left shoulder abduction limited by pain. Reports wanting the shoulder fixed properly."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Associated symptoms and red flags"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies radiation below the elbow, neck pain, numbness, tingling, weakness, or loss of grip. Denies trauma beyond the initial lift, fall, or dislocation. Denies systemic symptoms, fever, weight loss, night sweats, chest pain, shortness of breath, or abdominal pain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Alert and frustrated; not in obvious distress at rest."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder inspection and palpation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No deformity, swelling, erythema, or wasting. Tender over lateral deltoid insertion and upper trapezius. No bony tenderness over clavicle, AC joint, or humeral head; no warmth."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder range of motion"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Active abduction to approximately 110°, limited by pain; forward flexion to approximately 150°, painful at end range. External rotation mildly limited by pain; internal rotation painful when reaching behind the back. Passive range slightly greater than active, with pain only at end range and no hard block."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder strength and special tests"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Rotator cuff strength 5-/5, limited by pain but symmetrical; no focal weakness. Painful arc at 70–120°. Hawkins-Kennedy positive; Neer mildly positive; empty can painful with strength preserved. Speed and O’Brien tests equivocal."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Cervical spine examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Full range of motion, no tenderness, and Spurling test negative."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Upper-limb neurovascular examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Upper-limb neurovascular examination intact."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Fatigue"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient briefly reports “getting really tired all the time.”"
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/MedicationStatement/medication-statement-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "MedicationStatement",
        "id": "medication-statement-1",
        "status": "active",
